621 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(The declared functional dependencies show that sender identity, service catalog facts, assignment facts, coordinator details and completion-policy consequences have different determinants. The BCNF decomposition stores each fact with its determinant and preserves the stated dependencies. Under the changed high-read / periodic-correction workload, the strongest design approach is to keep this normalized schema as the source of truth and evaluate a controlled indexed read projection using real benchmark evidence. )/Pg 25 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

