1090 0 obj
<</Title(Let an authorization be valid only through pairwise approvals among Operator, Item and Channel. Represent the ternary relation AUTHORIZATION\(Operator, Item, Channel\). If the business rule states that a triple is valid exactly when its three pairwise projections exist and the ternary relation equals their natural join, the join dependency *\(Operator,Item\), \(Operator,Channel\), \(Item,Channel\)* holds. Decompose into OPERATOR_ITEM, OPERATOR_CHANNEL and ITEM_CHANNEL. This is a 5NF example because the non-trivial join dependency is not implied by a key dependency. Do not assume this decomposition is valid unless the pairwise-rule premise is explicitly true.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1065 0 R>>
endobj

