1104 0 obj
<</Title(The complete candidate-key set is {SenderID, ServiceID, DispatchWave} and {SenderID, ServiceCode, DispatchWave}. Every key must contain SenderID because no FD derives SenderID. Every key must contain DispatchWave because no FD derives DispatchWave. It must also contain either ServiceID or ServiceCode: ServiceID is not derivable from other attributes except ServiceCode, and ServiceCode is not derivable except from ServiceID. Removing any one member from either key therefore leaves at least one of these indispensable components missing.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1081 0 R/Next 1105 0 R>>
endobj

1105 0 obj
<</Title(Prime attributes are SenderID, ServiceID, ServiceCode and DispatchWave because each appears in at least one candidate key. All remaining attributes are non-prime.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1081 0 R/Prev 1104 0 R>>
endobj

